NOTES ON DATA AND THIRD-PARTY MODELS

The MIT terms above cover the code in this repository.

Derived data under data/ is computed from ChEMBL, which is released by the
EMBL-EBI under CC BY-SA 3.0. Redistribution of those derived tables is
therefore subject to CC BY-SA 3.0, not MIT. Please attribute ChEMBL and
preserve share-alike terms when redistributing data/.

Third-party model weights (SCScore, RAscore, BR-SAScore) are NOT contained in
this repository. They remain under their authors' own licences and are
downloaded from the authors' repositories by code/synthesizability/
fetch_vendor.py. SAscore and NP-likeness ship with RDKit (BSD-3-Clause).
